<title>UK: Zeneca sells Singapore resins plant.</title>
<headline>Zeneca sells Singapore resins plant.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pharmaceutical company Zeneca Group Plc said on Wednesday it had agreed to sell its resins manufacturing plant in Singapore to U.S. specialty chemicals group Morton International Inc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Zeneca said the transaction represented less than one percent of its net group assets. The sale, which includes the manufacturing plant, warehouse and office facilities, will be completed in May, the company said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
